# Eight posts round a centre, each kept on the ring and all of one size.
construction circle ring r 50 at 0,0
fix ring.center
circle post r 5 at 50,0
on post.center ring
array posts of post 8 around 0,0
on posts[2].center ring
on posts[3].center ring
on posts[4].center ring
on posts[5].center ring
on posts[6].center ring
on posts[7].center ring
on posts[8].center ring
equal posts[1] posts[2] posts[3] posts[4]
equal posts[5] posts[6] posts[7] posts[8]
